<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27820" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δογμᾰτ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lay down as an opinion,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀϊδίους εἶναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Piet.</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ αἰσχρά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					3.7.18
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.13
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ -οντες,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ δογματικοί</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(1).270
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ -όμενα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>P.</u>
					1.18
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>decree by ordinance,</i> c. inf., <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				4.83
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>1 Es.</u>
				6.34
			</span></i>; of the Roman Senate, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				14.10.22
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τινὰ καλήν</span>
			<i>declare</i> her beautiful, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.576
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Nicarch.
			</span></i>):—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ δογματισθέντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(3).173.53
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Astypalaea</span>), cf. ib. <i><span class="en">
				14.759.13
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Naples</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in 
				Pass.
			, of persons, <i>submit to ordinances,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ep.Col.
				2.20
			</span></i>.</div>
